  "id": "archive-folder-paths",
  "testedAt": "2026-09-18T09:27:00.209385+00:00",
  "rootCauses": [
    "Implicit folders lost the source pathSeparator, so Unix literal backslashes became separators during display and sorting.",
    "Sorting whole lowercased paths interleaved case-distinct directories and placed a same-name file between a directory header and its descendants.",
    "The default inspector skin did not consume the existing indentRpx field."
  ],
  "changes": [
    "Inherit separator semantics for synthesized folders.",
    "Sort path segments, retaining case-distinct subtrees; a same-name file precedes the entire directory subtree.",
    "Bind existing bounded indentation in the default skin; custom host skins remain outside module sync."
  ],
